From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: psx-place PS3 patch set (author not recorded) <>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 01:28:43 +0300
Subject: 0310-rtc-ps3.patch

Origin: the psx-place PS3 patch set by Sombat Tragoongoson, a fix added after glevand's
 OtherOS++ set; the original author is not recorded. Taken from https://github.com/damiandudycz/ps3 (files/kernel-patches/psx-place-Sombat-Tragoongoson/6.12).

diff --git a/drivers/rtc/rtc-ps3.c b/drivers/rtc/rtc-ps3.c
--- a/drivers/rtc/rtc-ps3.c
+++ b/drivers/rtc/rtc-ps3.c
@@ -53,7 +53,7 @@ static int __init ps3_rtc_probe(struct platform_device *dev)
 		return PTR_ERR(rtc);
 
 	rtc->ops = &ps3_rtc_ops;
-	rtc->range_max = U64_MAX;
+	rtc->range_max = S64_MAX;
 
 	platform_set_drvdata(dev, rtc);
 
